hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1759","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur unhey pahuncha tha ke aadmi Kinda mein hadees bayan karta hai aur us ne kaha: Qiyaamat key din dhuaan aaeyga aur munaafiqon key kaan aur unki aankhein pakdega aur momin ko naqseer jaisa pakdega. Jabke Ibn Masood tek lagaaey huey they, to ghussa huey aur baithey. To unhon-ne kaha: Jo jaanta hai wo kahey. Aur jo nahi jaanta wo kahey: Allah zyada jaanta hai. Beshak ilm mein se hai ke wo jo nahi jaanta uskey liye kahey: Main nahi jaanta. Beshak Allah ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se farmaya: (Kaho: Main tum se us par ujrat nahi maangta aur main takalluf karney walon mein se nahi hun). Aur beshak Quraish Islam se der karney lagey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un par baddua ki aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Unkey khilaaf meri madad farma saat key sath jaise Yusuf key saat! To unhey qahet ne pakad liya yahan tak ke wo us mein halaak huey aur murdaar aur haddiyaan khaayen. Aur aadmi aasmaan aur zameen key darmiyaan dhuein jaisa dekhta. To Aap key paas Abu Sufyan aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Tum rishtedaari jodney ka hukm deney aey ho. Aur beshak tumhaari qaum halaak hui hai. To Allah se dua karo! To Aap ne padha: (Intezaar karo jis din aasmaan wazeh dhuaan ley kar aaeyga) uskey qaul (wapas aaney waley) tak. Kya un se aakhirat ka azaab khola jaaeyga jab wo aaeyga, phir wo apne kufr ki taraf wapas aaein? To wo Allah Taala ka qaul hai: (Jis din ham badi pakad pakdengey) Badr ka din. Aur (laazim) Badr ka din. (Alif Laam Meem, Room maghloob ho gaey) (wo jald ghaalib aaengey) tak. Aur Room guzar chuka hai. (Bukhari: 4774). Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab ye aayat naazil hui: (Jo imaan laaey aur unhon-ne apne imaan ko zulm se nahi milaya) to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba par giraan guzra. Aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein kaun hai jis ne apne imaan ko zulm se nahi milaya? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak wo wo nahi hai. Kya tum Luqmaan key apne betey se qaul ko nahi suntey: (Beshak shirk bada zulm hai). (4776). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Allah Taala ka qaul: (To koi jaan nahi jaanti jo unkey liye aankhon ki thandak mein chhupaaya gaya hai)."
